<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F2.sf2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(b)</span> </span><span id="S3.F2.sf2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Shuffled process model (<math id="S3.F2.sf2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>M</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>).</span></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
